I've got surrounded as well, but the source of such cases where
it mattered was always a summoner, primarily a titan. Of course
you should dispose that summoner before you do anything else on
such a level. In cases that other (regular) hordes occasionally
appeared in my games it was due to my character staying too long
on that level, e.g. to bridge the water by boulder pushing. But
those hordes were less critical than the set of nasties from the
titan. It's of course also possible that an intelligent monster
happens to be equipped with a scroll of create monster, meets
you just on the ice bridge, and reads the scroll there; but this
seems to happen just as a defense action of monsters if the get
low on HPs. With any ice bridge, narrow or wide, you can quickly
pass the sea. A wide bridge has the advantage that you need not
even fight a monster (which potentially carries such a scroll),
just circumvent it.

